{"id":"00166","root":"uni00166_1","name":{"ja":"シュヴァリエ","en":"Chevalier"},"title":{"ja":"【桃華の賢者】","en":"【Peach Blossom Sage】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【桃華の賢者】 シュヴァリエ","en":"【Peach Blossom Sage】 Chevalier"},"element":"Spiritual","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":["Magic"],"release":"2019-02-28","limited":true,"characterId":38,"profile":{"ja":"魔界の子爵階級を持っている魔族。魔界の錬金術師の二つ名で呼ばれ、大量の蔵書を所持し、古の魔術などを研究している。争い事に興味はないが、自身の研究の邪魔をする者は容赦無く排除する。魔界だけでなく人間界にも現われ、珍しい書物や生物を収集、捕獲することもある。最近は人間界で色々と動きがある事に興味を惹かれ、訪れる頻度が増えた。その為にヨミハラやアミダハラ等の闇の街に活動拠点を置き、大量の蔵書や研究機材を持ち込んでいる。自身の持つ膨大な知識から、対魔忍こそがこの世界のキーになる可能性があると推測。研究の過程で、対魔忍以外にも人間界で古来から「魔除け」等として扱われる事象の研究も行っている。","en":"Chevalier is a demon of baron rank in the Demon Realm. She is known by the epithet \"Alchemist of the Demon Realm,\" possesses a massive library, and studies ancient magics. Though uninterested in conflict, she shows no mercy to anyone who hinders her research. She appears in both the Demon Realm and the Human Realm, collecting and capturing rare books and creatures. Lately she's become fascinated by the recent activity in the Human Realm, so she's visited more often. To support this, she has established bases in dark towns such as Yomihara and Amidahara, bringing in vast quantities of books and research equipment. From her extensive knowledge, she hypothesizes that Taimanin may be the key to this world's future. Her studies also cover phenomena traditionally used as \"warding charms\" in the Human Realm, beyond just Taimanin."},"illustrator":"のぶしと","voiceActor":"柊 奈々","forms":[{"id":"uni00166_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[928,1856],"sp":[170,170],"atk":[122,244],"def":[145,290],"spd":[45,45],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":35,"skills":["3","102001"]},{"id":"uni00166_2","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[1356,2712],"sp":[230,230],"atk":[179,358],"def":[225,450],"spd":[45,45],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":35,"skills":["3","102001","102002"]},{"id":"uni00166_3","rarity":6,"r